Third-party material
--------------------

src/omakase_bench/robots/d1/d1.urdf, d1.meshes.urdf and spec.json
    Composed robot description of the D1 from manipulation-kit, a motion
    library of the copyright holder named above (Apache License 2.0), copied
    unchanged.
    See src/omakase_bench/robots/d1/PROVENANCE.md.

src/omakase_bench/backends/mujoco/robot_mjcf.py (urdf_to_mjcf_string)
    Follows the URDF import settings of manipulation-kit's
    src/manipulation_kit/description/mjcf.py (Apache License 2.0).

Mesh files (src/omakase_bench/robots/d1/meshes/, 44 files listed in assets.yaml)
    Visual meshes of the D1 robot: body shells, gripper parts and
    arm links, copied unchanged from the manipulation-kit-assets repository
    of the same organisation at the commit assets.yaml records.

    Same copyright holder. Licensed under the Apache License,
    Version 2.0, like the rest of this repository: the files may be used,
    copied, modified and redistributed, also commercially, with this notice
    and the licence kept. The meshes describe the outer shape of the robot
    for simulation and rendering; no licence to manufacture the robot, and no
    trademark licence, is given. The copyright holder's name and the name "D1" may be
    used to say what the meshes depict.

Robot daemon API document (src/omakase_bench/robots/d1/api/openapi.json)
    A subset of the OpenAPI document of the D1 robot daemon, Copyright 2026
    the same copyright holder, copied unchanged and distributed under the
    Apache License 2.0 with the rest of this repository. The info.license field
    inside the copied document is the source repository's and is kept only
    because the subset is copied unchanged. See
    src/omakase_bench/robots/d1/api/PROVENANCE.md.

Camera interface description (src/omakase_bench/robots/d1/api/cameras.md)
    A description of the interfaces of the D1's camera software, written for
    this repository; it copies no source.
